{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootabox</strong> is a semi-idle incremental game where you collect items by opening lootboxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine gold by clicking with your mouse.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/5394234c9a4d95558b42a887dcce02a2.poster.avif?t=1761987484\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/5394234c9a4d95558b42a887dcce02a2.webm?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/5394234c9a4d95558b42a887dcce02a2.mp4?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase lootboxes from the shop. Different lootboxes offer different chances of getting certain items. So you have to choose wisely. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/74f91dad94e6672a4c803368634ee8d7.poster.avif?t=1761987484\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/74f91dad94e6672a4c803368634ee8d7.webm?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/74f91dad94e6672a4c803368634ee8d7.mp4?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Open lootboxes to get items. The whole opening experience is made to feel very satisfying and interactive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/7febb73699bd770b90a4c7d000c8fe0b.poster.avif?t=1761987484\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/7febb73699bd770b90a4c7d000c8fe0b.webm?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/7febb73699bd770b90a4c7d000c8fe0b.mp4?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Gain passive gold income and other effects from the items you collect.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/8cf32fa08802fb8f974e44d13614bb02.poster.avif?t=1761987484\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/8cf32fa08802fb8f974e44d13614bb02.webm?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/extras/8cf32fa08802fb8f974e44d13614bb02.mp4?t=1761987484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades to help you turn the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the items to win the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947710?t=1761987484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947710?t=1761987484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/e59a13e3a7740cc32568e7959ca46c026e66fc6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761987484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947710/e59a13e3a7740cc32568e7959ca46c026e66fc6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761987484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p c